{"book":"jeremiah","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T22:41:15.785178883Z","verse":9,"ref":"jeremiah 20:9","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":20,"translation":"And I said, I will not remember ⟨him⟩, and I will not speak any more in his name; and it was in my heart as a burning fire shut up in my bones, and I grew weary of containing ⟨it⟩, and I could not ⟨contain it⟩.","tokens":[{"surface":"ואמרתי","gloss":"And ⟨I⟩ said"},{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"אזכרנו","gloss":"I will remember ⟨him⟩"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"אדבר","gloss":"I will speak"},{"surface":"עוד","gloss":"again"},{"surface":"בשמו","gloss":"in his name"},{"surface":"והיה","gloss":"and it was"},{"surface":"בלבי","gloss":"in my heart"},{"surface":"כאש","gloss":"like fire"},{"surface":"בערת","gloss":"burning"},{"surface":"עצר","gloss":"shut up"},{"surface":"בעצמתי","gloss":"in my bones"},{"surface":"ונלאיתי","gloss":"and ⟨I⟩ was weary"},{"surface":"כלכל","gloss":"of holding ⟨it⟩"},{"surface":"ולא","gloss":"and not"},{"surface":"אוכל","gloss":"⟨I⟩ could not"}]}